    <string name="setup_battery_title">Keep it running</string>
    <string name="setup_battery_body">Android puts apps to sleep to save power, which would stop sharing overnight. The next screen asks whether Filo may keep running. Choose Allow.</string>
    <string name="setup_autorevoke_title">Do not pause Filo</string>
    <string name="setup_autorevoke_body">If a phone goes months without opening Filo, Android removes its permissions automatically and sharing dies silently. On the next screen, turn off "Pause app activity if unused".</string>
    <string name="permission_background_body_settings">Android will not ask about this inside the app. Tap Continue, then choose Permissions, then Location, then pick the option below.</string>
